    "abstract": "Parts figure for the windshield frame installation, showing the corner bracket in its pocketed and drained standards, the frame kit, the spar cap and the retaining fasteners.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure shows the windshield frame installation at one flight compartment window, with the corner bracket, the frame kit, the spar cap and the retaining fasteners.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the left hand windshield looking forward; the right hand side is a mirror image with the same part numbers. Items 20 and 20A are the corner bracket standards; the drained bracket at item 20 must be used with the higher temperature sealant and the bead profile called out in the installation task. The spar cap at item 30A is obsolete and is replaced by item 30 on any removal."
    },
